+     content it carries. -->
+
+## Request
+
+1. A customer's single-use welcome code was refused as already used after he cancelled the order that
+   used it and placed a corrected one.
+2. Support reports €4.90 shipping charged on an order whose goods came to exactly €50.00.
+
+## Done
+
+1. Cause: `OrderService.cancel` gave the coupon back under the customer's name instead of the order id,
+   so the coupon was never released. Fixed in `src/orders.ts`; test added in `test/orders.test.ts`.
+2. Not reproducible: shipping is free from 5000 cents of goods after discounts (fixed under task-001,
+   covered by an existing test). If the goods were €50.00 before discounts but less after, README says
+   shipping is charged; support should send the order id if it still looks wrong.
